      "at": "2026-11-16T07:57:52.967Z",
      "type": "agent_text",
      "text": "I didn't place an order, because the store can't confirm that any dock under $150 runs two 4K 60 Hz displays from a USB-C port.\n\n- **Demo Dock Duo Lite (OAW-DOCK-03), $89:** It isn't compatible. It supports only one display at 4K 60 Hz.\n- **Demo Dock Duo (OAW-DOCK-04), $129:** I can't confirm it fits. The USB-C port check passed. The store hasn't listed how many displays it can run at 4K 60 Hz. It has two video outputs and 90 W power delivery, but that doesn't show that both can run at 4K 60 Hz together.\n- **Demo Dock Travel (OAW-DOCK-01) and Demo Dock Solo (OAW-DOCK-02):** Each supports only one display at 4K 60 Hz.\n\nThe missing spec is the maximum number of 4K 60 Hz displays for the Demo Dock Duo.\n\nYou have three options:\n1. Wait until the store confirms the Duo's 4K 60 Hz spec, and I'll check again.\n2. Relax the requirement, for example one 4K 60 Hz display and a second at a lower refresh rate. I'd need to check the Duo Lite for that.\n3. Raise your budget. The store didn't show me any other docks, so I don't know of a confirmed option at a higher price."
    }
